WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.500
Figma, the specs and the code drift apart. Nobody sees it until a screen breaks.

00:04.500 --> 00:08.500
CHIP is the local bridge for BELLA. It checks all three against each other.

00:08.500 --> 00:13.500
It finds drift and gaps: 89 of 98 parts differ, 33 drifting. Read at 23 Nov 2026, 07:35.

00:13.500 --> 00:18.500
It writes a plan. You approve before anything runs.

00:18.500 --> 00:23.500
You press Start. Watch it land.

00:23.500 --> 00:27.000
CHIP. The local bridge for BELLA.
